  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can call upon your spirit’s granted abilities to take advantage of lapses in your opponents’ defenses.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Combat Reflexes, bind spirit class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever an opponent provokes an attack of opportunity from you, you may activate a granted ability instead of making a melee attack. The granted ability must have an activation time of 1 standard action. If you use a major granted ability as part of this feat, it is expended as usual.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/pact-magic-feats#toc55\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
